.TH COSMIC-SETTINGS-DAEMON 1 "2026-08-16" "cosmic-settings-daemon" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cosmic-settings-daemon \- settings D-Bus service for the COSMIC desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cosmic-settings-daemon
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cosmic-settings-daemon
provides the
.B com.system76.CosmicSettingsDaemon
D-Bus service used by the COSMIC desktop. It monitors COSMIC configuration and
state directories and exposes settings operations including display brightness,
audio volume, input-source switching, and accessibility state.
.PP
The daemon is normally started by the desktop session or its service manager.
.SH OPTIONS
This program does not accept command-line options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemd.service (5),
.BR dbus-daemon (1)
